#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.GENERIC"
msgid "I can't do that."
msgstr "할 수 없다."

