msgstr "안에 들어가지 않는다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.CANTLEARN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.CANTLEARN"
