msgstr "배울 수 없다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.KNOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.KNOWN"
