msgstr "잠겨 있다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ACTIONFAIL.WRITE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ACTIONFAIL.WRITE.GENERIC"
