msgstr "별로 배운 게 없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ANNOUNCE_MAGIC_FAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ANNOUNCE_MAGIC_FAIL"
