msgstr "여기에 몬스터가 있다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ANNOUNCE_TRO_MESSAGEBOTTLE.
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ANNOUNCE_TRO_MESSAGEBOTTLE."
