msgstr "지금은 너무 위험하다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP"
