msgstr "멈춰! 때가 왔다! 망치 시간!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.HANGING_VINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.HANGING_VINE"
