msgstr "진짜 당근이 아니다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RABID_BEETLE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RABID_BEETLE.DEAD"
