#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_COOKED"
