msgstr "끝장났다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE.BURNT"
