msgstr "고대의 쓰레기다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RELIC_2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RELIC_2.GENERIC"
