msgstr "건져야겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RELIC_4.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RELIC_4.GENERIC"
