msgstr "하나하나가 작은 수수께끼다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED"
