msgstr "부수기 딱 좋은 항아리인걸!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SMELTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SMELTER"
