msgstr "또 다른 지형이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TURF_PAINTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TURF_PAINTED"
