msgstr "머리를 벽에 쾅쾅 칠 때 유용할 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHEATHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHEATHAT"
