msgstr "풀이 필요할 때도 있으니까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED"
