msgstr "끄려면 꽤 고생해야 할 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL.GENERIC"
