msgstr "손으로 뜯기엔 너무 힘들어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL.PICKED"
