msgstr "버섯 튀김."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
