msgstr "멋쟁이 버섯."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
