msgstr "낮잠을 자고 있네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
