msgstr "가엾은 동물은 해치고 싶지 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT"
