msgstr "와, 엄청 크네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.HOGUSPORKUSATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.HOGUSPORKUSATOR"
