msgstr "이 좁은 데에 다 들어간다고?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Where the pigs kick back and relax."
