#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_FARM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_FARM.GENERIC"
