msgstr "탔지만 아주 좋아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.ROCK_FLIPPABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.ROCK_FLIPPABLE"
