msgid "I didn't bring my puddle stompin' boots!"
msgstr "물웅덩이를 밟아도 되는 부츠는 안 가져왔는데!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC"
