msgstr "이럴 수가! 정말이지..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC"
