msgstr "위기가 닥쳤을 때 도움이 될 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN"
