msgstr "피할 수 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC"
