msgstr "날씨와 제법 맞지 않는다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON"
