msgstr "전멸했다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SCORPION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SCORPION.GENERIC"
