msgstr "침으로 난동을 부리는 녀석이군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SCORPION.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SCORPION.SLEEPING"
