msgstr "제법 부주의하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO"
