msgstr "훌륭한 모둠 요리다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SEAGULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SEAGULL"
