msgstr "흔한 조개껍데기다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SEATRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SEATRAP"
