msgstr "꽤 축축하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_COOKED"
