msgstr "간신히 먹을 만하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_DRIED"
