msgstr "쓸 만하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_PLANTED"
