msgstr "참 특이한 가로등이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CLAWPALMTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CLAWPALMTREE"
