msgstr "조금 징그럽네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CLAWPALMTREE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CLAWPALMTREE_SAPLING"
