msgstr "껍질을 벗기기가 어렵다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COCONUT.PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COCONUT.PLANTED"
