msgstr "더는 가까이 오지 말아줘."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT1"
