msgstr "좀 더 빨리 걷게 해주지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.CANNONSHOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.CANNONSHOT"
