msgstr "분노의 굉음!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.CAPTAINHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.CAPTAINHAT"
