msgstr "뿔이 있으면 더 좋을 텐데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.CARGOBOAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.CARGOBOAT"
