msgstr "지하 세계로 가자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT"
