msgstr "암흑시대의 식물이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.CAVIAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.CAVIAR"
