msgstr "이럴 땐 불탄다고 해야겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_GENERAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_GENERAL.GENERIC"
