msgstr "설계와 도면으로 가득하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_WEAPONS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_WEAPONS.BURNING"
