msgstr "뭔가 극적인 느낌이 나는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PINECONE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PINECONE.GENERIC"
