msgstr "이게 즐거운가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIRATEPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIRATEPACK"
