msgstr "이거면 되겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIRATIHATITATOR.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIRATIHATITATOR.BURNT"
