msgstr "너무 공업용 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYERHOUSE_CITY.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYERHOUSE_CITY.BURNT"
