#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_FARM.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_FARM.BURNING"
