#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_MINE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_MINE.BURNING"
