msgstr "\"을불 다인붙\"... 하하! 돼지어잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIG_PALACE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIG_PALACE"
