msgstr "좋은 물건을 저기에 감춰 두는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_ENTRANCE.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_ENTRANCE.LOCKED"
