msgstr "아래에 뭐가 있지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_ENTRANCE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_ENTRANCE3"
