#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_ENTRANCE4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_ENTRANCE4"
