msgstr "어디로 이어질까? 알아보자."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_HEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_HEAD"
