msgstr "으윽, 뭐 때문에 부서졌을까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ROC_ROBIN_EGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ROC_ROBIN_EGG"
