msgstr "우린 순순히 당하지 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ROOTTRUNK_CHILD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ROOTTRUNK_CHILD"
