msgstr "곧 연료를 채워야겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.OFF"
