#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECKED_ENTRANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECKED_ENTRANCE"
