msgstr "메이데이! 메이데이! 신호가 약해진다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC"
