msgstr "마법이 깃든 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY"
