msgstr "저 안에 뭐가 들어가야 할 것 같은걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED"
