msgstr "밟지 않는 게 좋아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_PLANTED"
