msgstr "막대기에 고기를 꿰었네. 다음엔 뭘 생각해낼까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KEY_TO_CITY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KEY_TO_CITY"
