msgstr "사랑스러운 꼬마 아마존물총새구나!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KINGFISHER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KINGFISHER.SLEEPING"
