#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT.GENERIC"
