msgstr "사랑스럽구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEATHER"
