#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK_FULL"
