#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK_GOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK_GOLD"
