msgstr "과학을 위해 만드라고라 오피시나룸을 익힌 것이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MANGROVETREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MANGROVETREE"
