#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MANGROVETREE_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MANGROVETREE_BURNT"
