#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_MANOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_MANOR"
