msgstr "물이 샐 틈은 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE.BURNING"
