msgstr "니스식 요리법으로, 영양가가 높지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RAWLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RAWLING"
