msgstr "개인 위생에 필요한 도구지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RECONSTRUCTION_PROJECT.RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RECONSTRUCTION_PROJECT.RUBBLE"
