msgstr "재건축이 필요하겠는걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RECONSTRUCTION_PROJECT.SCAFFOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RECONSTRUCTION_PROJECT.SCAFFOLD"
