msgstr "재건축을 시작했다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.REDBARREL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.REDBARREL"
