msgstr "약간은 시원하겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RELIC.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RELIC.BROKEN"
