msgstr "달의 물리적인 조각인가? 흥미로운데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK_OBSIDIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK_OBSIDIAN"
