msgstr "정말 단단하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROC_HEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROC_HEAD"
