#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_BRANCH1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_BRANCH1"
