msgstr "오래돼 보이는걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_BRANCH2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_BRANCH2"
