msgstr "상당히 말라버렸군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_DEBRIS2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_DEBRIS2"
