msgstr "많이 시들었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_DEBRIS3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_DEBRIS3"
