msgstr "빨간 베리가 가장 맛있는걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED"
