msgstr "바깥은 지루해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_LARGE_SQUARE_CURTAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_LARGE_SQUARE_CURTAIN"
