msgstr "예쁜데 따분해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND"
