msgstr "불로 태울 수도 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND_BURLAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND_BURLAP"
