msgstr "훌륭한 배인걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGSHAT"
