msgstr "나에겐 어울리지 않는걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGSSAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGSSAIL"
