msgstr "좀 음침해 보이는걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY1"
