msgstr "무슨 열쇠지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY2"
