msgstr "또 다른 열쇠인걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOOD_DOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOOD_DOOR"
