msgstr "이런, 거미가 들어왔네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.RUG_WORMHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.RUG_WORMHOLE"
