#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL_LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL_LOW"
msgid "I'm not too interested in rocks."
