msgstr "쓸 만해 보인다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_BLACK_CAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_BLACK_CAT"
