msgstr "고양이는 쥐를 막아 준다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_CAPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_CAPE"
