msgstr "왕눈알이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DEFLATED_BALLOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DEFLATED_BALLOON"
