msgstr "방을 한쪽으로 쓰러뜨린다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_BAMBOOTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_BAMBOOTREE"
