msgstr "덤불도 자야 한다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC"
