msgstr "돼지들을 속이는 데 쓴다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD"
