msgstr "근처에 보물이 없다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC"
