msgstr "가까워졌다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC"
