msgstr "바다 짐승 지느러미다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DOUBLE_UMBRELLAHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DOUBLE_UMBRELLAHAT"
