#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYEGG_CRACKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYEGG_CRACKED"
