msgstr "보물이 가득할까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONEGG"
