msgstr "요리해도 별로 나아지지 않았다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS"
