msgstr "불 꺼졌다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.LOWFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.LOWFUEL"
