msgstr "돛이 바람을 못 받는다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.OFF"
