msgstr "우드렉스는 육지 농부가 아니다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED"
