msgstr "어떤 보물을 잡아먹었을까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SLOTMACHINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SLOTMACHINE"
