msgstr "꿈틀거리는 꼴 좀 봐라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT"
