msgstr "슬러틀이 안에 있겠지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME"
