msgstr "토사물처럼 생겼다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES"
