msgstr "나는 퍼즐 맞추기는 별로다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC"
