msgstr "너는 무슨 종류의 새냐?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY"
