#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.GENERIC"
