#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOON"
