msgstr "말 많은 볼트 상자다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12"
