msgstr "음악이 전혀 안 나온다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16"
