msgstr "뇌 굴리는 것이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2"
